    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.first().json.body;\n\nconst prompt = `Classify this inbound inquiry from a contact form. Return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nForm data:\n- Name: ${data.name}\n- Email: ${data.email}\n- Company: ${data.company || 'not provided'}\n- Inquiry type: ${data.inquiry_type}\n- Message: ${data.message}\n\nClassify into ONE of these categories:\n- \"urgent\": real business inquiry with budget signals (mentions money, deadlines, specific timelines) OR high-fit project request\n- \"regular\": legitimate inquiry without urgency signals\n- \"newsletter\": just wants to subscribe to newsletter or join mailing list\n- \"spam\": obvious spam, vendor pitch, irrelevant, suspicious content\n\nAlso score:\n- urgency_score: 1-10 (10 = needs immediate response)\n- estimated_budget: extract dollar amount if mentioned, else 0\n- key_signals: array of 1-3 specific words/phrases from message that drove the decision\n\nReturn JSON in this exact structure:\n{\n  \"category\": \"urgent/regular/newsletter/spam\",\n  \"urgency_score\": numeric,\n  \"estimated_budget\": numeric,\n  \"key_signals\": [\"signal1\", \"signal2\"],\n  \"suggested_reply_tone\": \"executive/consultative/friendly/polite_decline\",\n  \"reasoning\": \"1 sentence why\"\n}`;\n\nconst response = await this.helpers.httpRequest({\n  method: 'POST',\n  url: 'https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions',\n  headers: {\n    'Authorization': 'Bearer YOUR_GROQ_API_KEY_HERE',\n    'Content-Type': 'application/json'\n  },\n  body: {\n    model: 'llama-3.3-70b-versatile',\n    messages: [{ role: 'user', content: prompt }],\n    temperature: 0.1,\n    response_format: { type: 'json_object' }\n  },\n  json: true\n});\n\nconst parsed = JSON.parse(response.choices[0].message.content);\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    category: parsed.category || 'regular',\n    urgency_score: parsed.urgency_score || 0,\n    estimated_budget: parsed.estimated_budget || 0,\n    key_signals: (parsed.key_signals || []).join(', '),\n    suggested_reply_tone: parsed.suggested_reply_tone || 'consultative',\n    reasoning: parsed.reasoning || '',\n    name: data.name,\n    email: data.email,\n    company: data.company || '',\n    inquiry_type: data.inquiry_type,\n    message: data.message,\n    submitted_at: data.timestamp\n  }\n};"
      },
